[0.1.0]
* Initial version with PostgreSQL 18.6

[0.2.0]
* Add web panel with Cloudron login
* Admins create roles and databases, assign roles to users, and manage the allowed networks
* Users rotate passwords and delete databases of their own roles
* Audit log of all changes

[0.3.0]
* Admins can be set by username with PG_ADMINS in /app/data/env.sh
* Roles can be allowed to create their own databases up to a set maximum
* Fix form submissions being rejected by the browser origin check

[0.4.0]
* Database snapshots: create on demand, download as .dump or .sql, restore, delete
* A snapshot of the current state is taken automatically before every restore
* The number of snapshots kept per database is set with PG_MAX_SNAPSHOTS in /app/data/env.sh

[0.5.0]
* Automatic snapshots on a cron schedule (UTC, at most hourly) per database
* Manual, scheduled and before-restore snapshots are rotated separately
* Default number of kept snapshots raised to 7
* Restore has its own confirmation page, database deletion moved to a danger zone on the database page

[0.5.1]
* Fix snapshot downloads failing with permission denied for databases whose first snapshot was made after 0.4.0
* Database deletion returns to My databases unless an admin deletes another user's database
* Stream snapshot downloads instead of buffering them in nginx
* Remove partial snapshot files left by an interrupted worker
* Delete finished snapshot jobs after 30 days
* Stop the worker from logging errors while waiting for the panel's first migration
* Fix row borders in the snapshot table
